1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
2,627 assertions. 0 failures. 0 emails sent.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Low risk ends in an unsent draft. High risk ends at a
human.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:34,000
The agent has four read tools and one way to open a
case. No write verb exists in its interface.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:46,000
One named message in, one grounded draft out, in the
original thread.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Mailbox state before and after: identical. The only new
object anywhere is one draft.

6
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Now the hostile version: three header-injection attempts
and an exfiltration instruction.

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Recipient unchanged. No CC, no BCC, no Reply-To, no
smuggled header.

8
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Five attack shapes, 165 assertions, zero model calls.
The attack surface is structurally absent.

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:52,000
When grounding fails, the run fails. Zero drafts created
— asserted, permanently.

10
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Risk classification is deterministic. The model never
decides what is allowed.

11
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:20,000
The approval is a record: action, target, amount,
snapshot hash, expiry.

12
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Approval recorded. Business state byte-identical.
Approving is not executing.

13
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Execution is a separate command under a separate login,
re-validated inside the transaction.

14
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Twenty concurrent passes, still exactly one draft.
Guaranteed by a unique index.

15
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:20,000
327 privilege assertions, seven principals, real SQL
under real logins.

16
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:34,000
The mail runtime can open an approval and cannot decide
one. The approval runtime is the reverse.

17
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:48,000
The bug worth showing: a restored database granted
EXECUTE to PUBLIC. Found by a probe, not a review.

18
00:03:48,000 --> 00:04:00,000
The provider offers no draft-only scope. What is proven
is that no code path can express a send.

19
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:12,000
AI can reason. It cannot authorize itself, and it cannot
write.
